    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/kiddush">
        <tei:pb ed="1965" n="22" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n36.jpg"/>
        <tei:head xml:lang="en">Kiddush for the New Year</tei:head>
        <tei:note type="instruction" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n36.jpg" xml:lang="en">After the evening prayer but before <tei:foreign xml:lang="he">עלינו</tei:foreign> the Kiddush is recited over a glass of wine. At home too, it is recited before the meal, but on the Sabbath preceded by <tei:foreign xml:lang="he">ויכלו</tei:foreign></tei:note>
        <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/text/vayekhulu@prayerbook_for_the_new_year-marmorstein-1965-en"/>
        <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:borei_peri_hagafen@prayerbook_for_the_new_year-marmorstein-1965-en"/>
        <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:kiddush_rosh_hashanah@prayerbook_for_the_new_year-marmorstein-1965-en"/>
        <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:shehecheyanu@prayerbook_for_the_new_year-marmorstein-1965-en"/>
        <tei:note type="instruction" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n36.jpg" xml:lang="en">After Kiddush at the meal, one recites <tei:foreign xml:lang="he">המוציא</tei:foreign> over the two loaves. After tasting the bread one dips a piece of sweet apple in honey and says:</tei:note>
        <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:borei_peri_haetz@prayerbook_for_the_new_year-marmorstein-1965-en"/>
        <tei:note type="instruction" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n36.jpg" xml:lang="en">Then one eats the piece of apple and says:</tei:note>
        <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:shetechaddesh_aleinu_shanah_tovah@prayerbook_for_the_new_year-marmorstein-1965-en"/>
        <tei:note type="instruction" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n36.jpg" xml:lang="en">On the eve of the New Year friends and acquaintances express their good wishes to one another in the following phrase:</tei:note>
        <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/greeting@prayerbook_for_the_new_year-marmorstein-1965-en"/>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
